{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.32894741,35.51731643]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"parks_playgrounds","name":"三増公園","category":"nature","address":"愛甲郡愛川町","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"14401","municipality_pref":"神奈川県","municipality_name":"愛川町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.3002845,35.54832188]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"parks_playgrounds","name":"馬込公園","category":"nature","address":"愛甲郡愛川町","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"14401","municipality_pref":"神奈川県","municipality_name":"愛川町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.30898927,35.54056868]}}],"display_comment_original":"愛川町周辺には、近世村の記憶として熊坂村、八菅村、半縄村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には寺社や信仰の場に関わる場所が見え、八菅神社、八菅山経塚のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では熊坂村、八菅村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに水辺の暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を示す案内板に加え、治水碑や河川改修の記念碑が狙い目になる。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":["茅誠司","中村璋八","長谷川恒男","平林定兵衛"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["郷土資料館","古民家「山十邸」","三増峠古戦場","半原温泉","神奈川県立あいかわ公園","八菅山いこいの森","大相模カントリークラブ","東名厚木カントリー倶楽部"],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%84%9B%E5%B7%9D%E7%94%BA","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q4218371","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q20041882","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q15830526","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11483114"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"愛川町","wikipedia_revision_id":"110347443","wikidata_qid":"Q1203267","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%84%9B%E5%B7%9D%E7%94%BA","japan_search_query_url":"","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}